  "remarks": "JSC Mir Business Bank is a Moscow-based financial institution in Russia, acting as the primary gateway for economic cooperation between Russia and Iran. It is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Bank Melli Iran, the largest state-owned bank in Iran. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, JSC Mir Business Bank is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
